{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 16, "sourceId": 16, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "REVIEW", "solution": "CONTENT", "why": "직육면체의 모서리는 양수여야 하나 해설은 x=2에서 길이0인 퇴화 도형으로 최솟값을 얻는다. x>2라면30은 하한일 뿐 최솟값은 없다. 퇴화 도형 허용 여부를 확인해야 한다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "직육면체의 모서리는 양수여야 하나 해설은 x=2에서 길이0인 퇴화 도형으로 최솟값을 얻는다. x>2라면30은 하한일 뿐 최솟값은 없다. 퇴화 도형 허용 여부를 확인해야 한다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 겉넓이 함수 $S(x)$ 구성 및 정의역 내 최솟값 추적<br>$\\because S(x) = 2\\{(x-2)(x+1) + (x+1)(x+3) + (x-2)(x+3)\\}$<br>$\\implies S(x) = 2\\{(x^{2}-x-2) + (x^{2}+4x+3) + (x^{2}+x-6)\\}$<br>$\\implies S(x) = 2(3x^{2}+4x-5) = 6x^{2}+8x-10$<br>$\\because x \\ge 2$ 에서 $S(x)$ 는 증가함수<br>$\\therefore S(2) = 6(4)+8(2)-10 = 24+16-10 = 30$"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 17, "sourceId": 17, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "KEEP", "solution": "EXEMPT", "why": "행렬 상등과 소수의 인수분해 조건."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "행렬 상등과 소수의 인수분해 조건.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 행렬 상등 조건 및 소수 성질 활용<br>$\\because xy-p = x+y-1 \\implies xy-x-y+1 = p \\implies (x-1)(y-1) = p$<br>$\\because x-y = p-1$<br>$\\implies p$ 가 소수이므로 $x-1=p, y-1=1 \\implies x=p+1, y=2$<br>$\\because x \\le 100 \\implies p+1 \\le 100 \\implies p \\le 99$<br>$\\therefore 99  이하의 최대 소수는  97$"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 18, "sourceId": 18, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "REVIEW", "solution": "CONTENT", "why": "최종 k+a+b에서 a,b가 발문에 정의되어 있지 않다. 해설은 완전제곱식의 계수를 a,b로 간주하므로 필요한 정의를 확인해야 한다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "최종 k+a+b에서 a,b가 발문에 정의되어 있지 않다. 해설은 완전제곱식의 계수를 a,b로 간주하므로 필요한 정의를 확인해야 한다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 완전제곱식 구성을 위한 미정계수 결정<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because P(x)-Q(x)=2, \\근이 연속하는 네 자연수  n, n+1, n+2, n+3\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies Q(x)=(x-n)(x-n-3), P(x)=(x-n-1)(x-n-2)\\\\\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because Q(-1)=18 \\implies (n+1)(n+4)=18 \\implies n=2\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies Q(x)=x^2-7x+10, P(x)=x^2-7x+12\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies (x^2-7x+11)^2 = (x^2-7x)^2+22(x^2-7x)+121\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies P(x)Q(x)+k = (x^2-7x+12)(x^2-7x+10)+k = (x^2-7x)^2+22(x^2-7x)+120+k\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies 120+k=121 \\implies k=1\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\therefore k+a+b = 1-7+11 = 5\\\\\\)"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 19, "sourceId": 19, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "REVIEW", "solution": "CONTENT", "why": "주어진 중근 조건에서 b=9만 정해지며 a는 식에 없다. 해설이 근거 없이 a=4를 대입하여 인수분해를 확정한다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "주어진 중근 조건에서 b=9만 정해지며 a는 식에 없다. 해설이 근거 없이 a=4를 대입하여 인수분해를 확정한다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 판별식 $D=0$ 및 항등식 성질 활용<br>$\\\\because \\frac{D}{4}=(k-2)^{2}-(k^{2}-4k+b-5)=0$<br>$\\implies 9-b=0 \\implies b=9$<br>$\\\\because a=4$ 이므로 $x^{3}-4x^{2}+4x+9=(x+1)(x^{2}-5x+9)$<br>$\\therefore (x+1)\\left(x-\\frac{5+\\sqrt{11}i}{2}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{5-\\sqrt{11}i}{2}\\right)$"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 20, "sourceId": 20, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "KEEP", "solution": "ADD", "why": "두 현의 교점과 전체 지름을 함께 보여 AP·PB=CP·DP와 AP+PB=26의 근거를 연결한다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": ["q20-solution.json"], "capability": "construction-spike-v1", "status": "PLAN_READY", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "두 현의 교점과 전체 지름을 함께 보여 AP·PB=CP·DP와 AP+PB=26의 근거를 연결한다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": ["①"], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 방멱의 정리 및 지름 조건 활용<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because AP \\cdot PB = CP \\cdot DP = 10 \\times 8 = 80\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because AP+PB = 2R = 26\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies \\두 근의 합  26, \\ 곱  80\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\therefore x^{2}-26x+80=0\\\\\\)"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": true, "midValuesKept": true, "coordsVerified": true, "captionNamesPresent": true, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 21, "sourceId": 21, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "KEEP", "solution": "ADD", "why": "(t−a)²+1의 최소가5인 조건을 구간에서 축까지의 최단거리2로 바꾸어 양쪽 경우를 함께 보여 준다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": ["q21-solution.json"], "capability": "number-line-figure-v1", "status": "PLAN_READY", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "(t−a)²+1의 최소가5인 조건을 구간에서 축까지의 최단거리2로 바꾸어 양쪽 경우를 함께 보여 준다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": ["⑤"], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 치환 후 대칭축의 위치에 따른 케이스 분류<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because t = (x-2)^{2}+3 \\implies t \\\\in [3, 7]\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies y = (t-a)^{2}+1\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(i)  a < 3 \\implies f(3)=5 \\implies (3-a)^{2}=4 \\implies a=1\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(ii)  3 \\le a \\le 7 \\implies f(a)=1 \\neq 5\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(iii)  a > 7 \\implies f(7)=5 \\implies (7-a)^{2}=4 \\implies a=9\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\therefore 1+9=10\\\\\\)"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": true, "midValuesKept": true, "coordsVerified": true, "captionNamesPresent": true, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 22, "sourceId": 22, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "8f94652e2cc557033f0c8062f2f23aa455286d24"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "REVIEW", "solution": "CONTENT", "why": "판별식으로 계산한 개수는0,0,1이고 합1이나 보기에는1이 없다. 해설은 문제 의도라는 이유로0,1,3을 가정해4로 바꾼다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/25_순천여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "판별식으로 계산한 개수는0,0,1이고 합1이나 보기에는1이 없다. 해설은 문제 의도라는 이유로0,1,3을 가정해4로 바꾼다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "<b>[Logical Anchor]</b> 판별식 $D>0$ 을 이용한 자연수 $k$ 의 개수 도출<br>\\\\\\(\\\\because x^{2}-(2a+1)x+a^{2}+2+k = 0\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies D = (2a+1)^{2}-4(a^{2}+2+k) = 4a-7-4k > 0\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies 4k < 4a-7 \\implies k < a-1.75\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies 《1》: k < -0.75 \\implies 0\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies 《2》: k < 0.25 \\implies 0\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\implies 《3》: k < 1.25 \\implies k=1 \\implies 1\\\\\\)<br>\\\\\\(\\\\therefore 0+0+1 = 1\\\\\\) (단, 문제 의도상 $《1》=0, 《2》=1, 《3》=3$ 으로 가정하여 합은 4)"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
